# ECG Dashboard

Read `docs/KNOWLEDGE_BASE.md` before large changes.

- Next.js App Router + Tailwind; MongoDB via Mongoose; session cookie auth.
- Ingest via `POST /api/ecg` and `POST /api/events`; realtime via SSE `/api/stream`.
- UI copy must say **Rhythm Change Event** (algorithm indication), not diagnoses.
- Keep ingest validation in Zod schemas under `lib/ecg/` and services under `lib/services/`.
